[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF5555]⚡ What is CustomBosses?[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[B]CustomBosses[/B] is an ultra-modern, fully rewritten boss creation and automated spawner plugin designed for server administrators who want thrilling PvE boss encounters without lag, memory leaks, or complex setup.

Unlike legacy abandoned plugins, [B]CustomBosses[/B] contains [B]0% bloat, 0% unsafe code, and zero NMS dependencies[/B], ensuring flawless stability across Minecraft 1.21.11 through 26.3 and full Folia multi-threading readiness!

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFAA00]✨ Key Features[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]🖥️ Complete In-Game GUI Control Panel[/B] - Edit boss attributes, custom health, scale, damage, equipment, drops, and abilities with zero YAML editing required!
[*][B]⚔️ 38 Unique Boss Abilities[/B] - Devastating attacks including Kill Aura, Getsuga Tenshou, Earthquakes, Poison Fogs, Phoenix Resurrection, Minion Clones, and Phase Transitions!
[*][B]🗺️ 3 Automated Spawner Systems[/B]:
[LIST]
[*][B]Region Spawners[/B]: Define 3D cuboid zones using the admin wand with mob caps, intervals, and day/night checks.
[*][B]Coordinate Spawners[/B]: Timed spawns at exact X/Y/Z positions or triggered on real-world calendar dates!
[*][B]Natural Spawners[/B]: Proximity-based wilderness spawns respecting light levels, world filters, and player distances.
[/LIST]
[*][B]🔮 Sacrificial Altars[/B] - Create physical world altars with floating holograms that require tribute sacrifices to awaken mythical bosses!
[*][B]🛡️ Stacker Compatibility[/B] - Built-in anti-stacking protection for WildStacker, RoseStacker, StackMob, and UltimateStacker so custom bosses and mounts never get merged into regular mob stacks!
[*][B]🏆 Ranked Damage Contribution Rewards[/B] - Reward players fairly! Give unique items and run custom console commands for Top 1, Top 2, Top 3 damage dealers, the final killer, or all participants!
[*][B]📊 Built-In Boss Bars & Dynamic Names[/B] - Color-coded health bars, custom styles (Solid, Notched), and live health percentage placeholders.
[*][B]🥚 Custom Boss Spawn Eggs[/B] - Create, save, and distribute one-click spawn eggs to players or crate rewards.
[*][B]🪄 Admin Selection Wand[/B] - Left-click pos 1, right-click pos 2, and shift-right-click to quickly select and spawn bosses anywhere.
[*][B]🧩 PlaceholderAPI Integration[/B] - Display active boss counts, individual boss health, and server stats on scoreboards or menus.
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

