[TR][TD][B]Leap Attack[/B][/TD][TD]Periodic[/TD][TD]High-speed lunging leap towards distant combatants.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Web Trap[/B][/TD][TD]Periodic[/TD][TD]Ensnare target in temporary webs that dissolve after 4 seconds.[/TD][/TR]
