[TR][TD][B]Zeus Strike[/B][/TD][TD]Periodic[/TD][TD]Strikes lightning bolts down on nearby players.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Toxic Fog[/B][/TD][TD]Periodic[/TD][TD]AOE poison cloud inflicting damage over time.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Freeze Zone[/B][/TD][TD]Periodic[/TD][TD]Freezes targets in place with heavy slowness and ice particles.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Vacuum Items[/B][/TD][TD]Periodic[/TD][TD]Sucks in ground items and heals the boss for each item consumed.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Hunger Drain[/B][/TD][TD]Periodic[/TD][TD]Drains the food bar of nearby adventurers.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Teleport Swap[/B][/TD][TD]Periodic[/TD][TD]Swaps positions between the boss and a player.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Power Wave[/B][/TD][TD]Periodic[/TD][TD]Sonic shockwave that damages equipment durability.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Soul Mark[/B][/TD][TD]Periodic[/TD][TD]Marks a player; deals massive true damage if they fail to escape.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Freeze Attack[/B][/TD][TD]On Attack[/TD][TD]Melee strikes slow and freeze victim.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Toss Attack[/B][/TD][TD]On Attack[/TD][TD]Melee hits launch players skyward.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Life Steal[/B][/TD][TD]On Attack[/TD][TD]Siphons health from victims directly to the boss.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Witchcraft[/B][/TD][TD]On Attack[/TD][TD]Inflicts blindness and weakness curses on melee hit.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Execute Threshold[/B][/TD][TD]On Attack[/TD][TD]Instantly slays players whose health is below the set percentage.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Target Cleanse[/B][/TD][TD]On Attack[/TD][TD]Strips all positive potion buffs from the target.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Thorns Armor[/B][/TD][TD]On Damaged[/TD][TD]Reflects sharp physical damage back to close-range attackers.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Quick Buff[/B][/TD][TD]On Damaged[/TD][TD]Grants the boss Speed and Resistance buffs upon taking damage.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Counter Hit[/B][/TD][TD]On Damaged[/TD][TD]Reflects a percentage of incoming damage directly back to the attacker.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Self Cleanse[/B][/TD][TD]On Damaged[/TD][TD]Purges all negative potion effects immediately.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Phoenix Immortal[/B][/TD][TD]On Death[/TD][TD]Chance to rise from the ashes at full health with a fiery explosion![/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Shadow Clones[/B][/TD][TD]On Death[/TD][TD]Duplicates into multiple clones upon demise.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Minion Spawner[/B][/TD][TD]On Death[/TD][TD]Summons minion bosses to avenge their leader.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Last Effect[/B][/TD][TD]On Death[/TD][TD]Afflicts the killer with a fatal wither/slowness curse.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Death Explosion[/B][/TD][TD]On Death[/TD][TD]Spawns primed TNT upon defeat.[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]Fatal Curse[/B][/TD][TD]On Death[/TD][TD]Takes the killer down to the grave together![/TD][/TR]
