[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFAA00]📜 Commands & Permissions[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]/cb menu[/B] (or [B]/cb gui[/B]) - Open the interactive management GUI ([B]custombosses.menu[/B])
[*][B]/cb spawn <boss_id> [world x y z][/B] - Spawn a boss ([B]custombosses.spawn[/B])
[*][B]/cb spawnegg <boss_id> [player] [amount][/B] - Give a boss spawn egg ([B]custombosses.egg[/B])
[*][B]/cb wand[/B] - Give admin selection wand ([B]custombosses.wand[/B])
[*][B]/cb altar <create|remove|list> ...[/B] - Manage sacrificial altars ([B]custombosses.altar[/B])
[*][B]/cb spawner <create|remove|list> ...[/B] - Manage automated spawners ([B]custombosses.spawner[/B])
[*][B]/cb killall [boss_id][/B] - Kill all active bosses ([B]custombosses.kill[/B])
[*][B]/cb list[/B] - View loaded boss profiles ([B]custombosses.list[/B])
[*][B]/cb reload[/B] - Reload configurations ([B]custombosses.reload[/B])
[/LIST]

